hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"193","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne mujhe yeh khilaya aur meri kisi taqat-quvvat ke baghair mujhe yeh rozi di. [Khane ke baad padhe]"
"194","[AI-translation] Allah ke liye bahut, pakeeza, babarkat tareef; badla na diya ja sake, na chhodi ja sake, na beniyazi ho sake [tareef]; ae hamare Rab. [Khane ke baad]"
